@startuml oauth2-flow
!theme plain
title Backend OAuth2 Authorization Code Flow

actor User
participant Browser
participant "Spring Boot\n:8081" as app
participant "Keycloak\n:8080" as kc

== Authorization Code Flow ==

User -> Browser : 보호된 리소스 접근
Browser -> app : GET /protected
app -> Browser : 302 → /oauth2/authorization/keycloak

Browser -> app : GET /oauth2/authorization/keycloak
app -> Browser : 302 → Keycloak /auth

Browser -> kc : GET /realms/practice/protocol/openid-connect/auth
kc -> Browser : 로그인 페이지
User -> Browser : 인증 (Direct / Google / GitHub)
Browser -> kc : 자격증명 제출
kc -> Browser : 302 → callback?code=xxx&state=yyy

Browser -> app : GET /login/oauth2/code/keycloak?code=xxx
app -> kc : POST /token (code, client_secret)
kc -> app : Access Token + ID Token + Refresh Token

app -> app : SecurityContext 저장
app -> Browser : 302 → /protected
Browser -> app : GET /protected (with session)
app -> Browser : 200 OK (보호된 리소스)

note over app
  Spring Security OAuth2 Client
  ---
  - OAuth2LoginAuthenticationFilter
  - OidcUserService
  - SecurityContextHolder
end note

note over kc
  Token Endpoint
  ---
  POST /realms/practice/protocol/openid-connect/token

  Response:
  - access_token (JWT)
  - id_token (JWT)
  - refresh_token
  - expires_in
end note

@enduml
